\f[V]portrule(host, port)\f[R]
T}@T{
Runs the script against \f[V]port\f[R] if it returns true; asked for
every port that is \f[V]open\f[R], \f[V]open|filtered\f[R] or
\f[V]unfiltered\f[R]
T}
T{
\f[V]postrule()\f[R]
T}@T{
Runs the script once after the scan if it returns true
T}
